WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.040
- Welcome back.

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.220
Sometimes I save the best
stories for last you all.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.247
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.247 --> 00:00:06.327
(Drum music)

00:00:06.327 --> 00:00:07.950
(crowd cheering)

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.370
After a year of remote learning,

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.240
most kids are back in the classroom.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.690
But for one younger sibling,

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.850
the transition has been a little rough.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.740
Eighteen months old Emmy seen
here with her older brothers,

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.350
was used to being around
them all day, every day.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.400
All three are her heroes.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.860
Now that the boys are back in school,

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.750
it's just Emmy and her mama.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.870
And she waits for them to come home.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.890
Folks, if you need a reason
to smile or cry in a good way,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.740
this is Emmy's reaction when
they get off the school bus.

00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:37.954
(excited kids yelling)

00:00:50.627 --> 00:00:52.388
(crowd clapping)

00:00:52.388 --> 00:00:54.137
I mean, what?

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.750
Let's say hi to Emmy
along with her brothers

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:59.733
Liam, Levy and Lucas and mama Brittany.

00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:02.590
Oh my gosh!

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.360
So Brittany, this is the
sweetest dang thing ever.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.870
And honestly, Emmy is adorable,

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.590
but seeing Liam and all of them

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:11.070
just run to her as well,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.240
as the sweetest thing ever.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.090
So does everyday look like this?

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.880
Is this every day after school?

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.760
- Literally every day.
She's our little COVID baby.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.460
And she was born a month
before COVID started

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:24.150
and all those quarantine business.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.540
So she's used to her entire life revolving

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.420
around these big brothers.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.730
- Oh my gosh. That must
be like so drastic.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.410
You know, it's all change.

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.750
So, to all of you, young men,

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.160
I mean, it seems like you
guys miss her as well, right?

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.212
Y'all are running to her.

00:01:39.212 --> 00:01:40.045
- (unison) Yeah!

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.120
I got a thumbs up. Oh my God.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.220
Well, oh my gosh.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:48.033
You're the cutest family.
Look at that picture.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.820
Oh my gosh. Well, thank you so much

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.340
for sharing this video, these pictures.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.250
This is, it makes my heart smile.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.160
It's so good for us to see
such magical little families

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.050
and also to remind ourselves,

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:01.883
you know, oh God,

00:02:01.883 --> 00:02:03.050
I wish my kids did that.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.920
They're like they love
when the other one leaves.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.270
But I'm liking your posts
right now. All right.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.460
And that's not all.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.750
Our season long partner

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.266
Pilot Van Makers of G2,

00:02:17.266 --> 00:02:18.099
the go-to pin at the Kelly Clarkson show

00:02:18.099 --> 00:02:20.050
thinks your video is as sweet as we do.

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.970
So they're going to use
their G2 gel ink pen

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.140
to write you a check
for a thousand dollars.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.140
How does that sound?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.130
You can have a lot of fun with that.

